  'Scheduled tasks have not run recently: check the server cron job (Hostinger: hPanel › Advanced › Cron Jobs).' => 'As tarefas agendadas não foram executadas recentemente: verifique o cron job do servidor (Hostinger: hPanel › Advanced › Cron Jobs).',
